{"unit_id": "tag:04I7:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）。设<MATH_0003>是局部赋环拓扑斯（locally ringed topoi）的态射（morphism）。则存在唯一的概形（schemes）态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，使得<MATH_0005>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0006>。换言之，构造<MATHSEG_0001>局部赋环拓扑斯（Locally ringed topoi）<MATHSEG_0002>是全忠实（fully faithful）的（右侧的态射（morphisms）按<MATH_0007>-同构（isomorphisms）取类）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed topoi", "target_term": "局部赋环拓扑斯"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Locally ringed topoi", "target_term": "局部赋环拓扑斯"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定概形及其态射。"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed topoi", "target_term": "局部赋环拓扑斯", "context": "给定态射所处的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "局部赋环拓扑斯及概形的态射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "两个给定态射同构。"}, {"source_term": "Locally ringed topoi", "target_term": "局部赋环拓扑斯", "context": "显示构造的目标。"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实", "context": "构造的全忠实性。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "右侧的态射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "右侧态射按高阶同构取类。"}], "notes": []}
